              "question": "िततीषःदुस्तरं मोहादुडुपेना सागरम् । िवशदयत ।",
              "solution_html": "<ul class=\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 my-1 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\"><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">क्व सयू प्र भवो वशं ः क्व चाल्पवषया मतः ।</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">ततीषदु स्ु तरं मोहादडु ुपेनािस्म सागरम ्।। ( रघवु शं म ्सगः 1 श्लोकः 2 )</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">ഈ ോകം അതി ഉപക്രമം സന്ദ അ ഉപസംഹാരം എഴുതിയിട്ടുെി</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">െ ർഭവും ർത്ഥവും ൽ</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">മുഴുവ മാ നാം.</li><li class=\"leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\">ൻ ർക്കും</li></ul>",
              "final_answer": "ൻ ർക്കും",
